      "message": "Build the focused Preskill v5 reader bridge\n\nAdd one shared background map and crosswalk, explain the flagged channel and finite-block coding route, and preserve direct expert access. Generate native pages from the existing editorial sources. Fix anchor-heading separation in the HTML conversion without changing canonical files or equations.\n\nLocal integrity, 96 tests, 17-route HTML checks and starting-byte preservation pass. Recorded local browser/Pandoc installation limits remain explicit. The implementation report is a checkpoint pending browser CI and final walkthrough records. No scientific evaluation, source repair, protected figure change or deployment.",
